	measure '% 65+' = ```
			
			
			VAR _NUMERATOR = 
			
			CALCULATE(
			    SUM('PLS_Summary'[Counter])
			    ,'Ref_Age'[Age] >= 65
			)
			
			VAR _DENOMINATOR = 
			
			SUM('PLS_Summary'[Counter])
			
			RETURN
			
			SWITCH(
			    TRUE(),
			    (_NUMERATOR / _DENOMINATOR) = BLANK(), 0,
			    (_NUMERATOR / _DENOMINATOR)
			)
			```
		formatString: 0.0%;-0.0%;0.0%
		lineageTag: 88f325b5-d520-46f7-b7ab-55d2fa7e5f4e

